correction:sá-ni-tas (end of the verse) ni(ed) tas(d) to ni(fe) tas(e), as printed on p. [161], staff 4 (archive.org item gradualesacrosan0000cath, leaf 746): the clivis starts on the f line and the last punctum sits in the space below it, so the verse ends on the mode-7 final like the jubilus (eval/offfinal-supplement-report.md);
